32738]; Tsunenari et al., 2003 [PubMed 12907679]).[supplied by OMIM, Mar 2008].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q8N1M1","text":"Ligand-gated anion channel that allows the movement of chloride monoatomic anions across cell membranes when activated by calcium (Ca2+)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}